# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Superseded and invalid artefacts -- present on disk, deliberately not shipped
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# These reports were produced before 2026-09-21, when the harness emitted every
# assertion inside `ifdef FORMAL without ever defining FORMAL. The preprocessor
# stripped the properties, so each "PASS (Formally Proven)" is a proof about an
# empty property set. Their kill-rate, vacuity and pruning figures were also
# constants in the generator rather than measurements. They must be regenerated,
# not cited.
COMPREHENSIVE_SILICON_BENCHMARK_REPORT.md
UNIVERSAL_SILICON_FORMAL_VERIFICATION_REPORT.md
COMPOSITION_ABLATION_COMMERCIAL_REPORT.md
GRAND_BUG_HUNT_CAMPAIGN_REPORT.md
PICORV32_FORMAL_SWEEP_REPORT.md

# Absolute-path symlink to a local oss-cad-suite install; meaningless elsewhere.
/tools

# LaTeX build intermediates
*.aux

# New runs go to outputs/ (ignored above); the paper's results live in results/.
